Self-evolving agent runtime: Rust core (fiber lifecycle, context/events, hot-reloading loader) + Luau plugins

Usage: metis <COMMAND>

Commands:
  greet  Print a greeting
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
